From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Winlator-Mali <build@winlator-mali>
Subject: [PATCH] FEXCore: Helio G99 JIT tuning for Cortex-A76

Tune JIT parameters for Cortex-A76 (big core on Helio G99):
- Increase MaxInst from 5000 to 8000 (A76 has 64KB L1I cache)
- Expand multiblock forward branch distance for A76 branch predictor

Cortex-A76 has:
- 64KB L1I cache (vs 32KB on A55)
- 256KB L2 cache
- 4-wide decode width
- Better branch prediction than A55

These settings optimize for the A76 big core while remaining
compatible with A55 little cores.
---
 FEXCore/Source/Interface/Config/Config.json.in | 2 +-
 FEXCore/Source/Interface/Core/Frontend.cpp     | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/FEXCore/Source/Interface/Config/Config.json.in b/FEXCore/Source/Interface/Config/Config.json.in
index 1234567..abcdefg 100644
--- a/FEXCore/Source/Interface/Config/Config.json.in
+++ b/FEXCore/Source/Interface/Config/Config.json.in
@@ -100,7 +100,7 @@ namespace FEXCore::Config {
     ],
     "MaxInst": [
       "MaxInst",
-      {"Type": "int32", "Default": "5000"},
+      {"Type": "int32", "Default": "8000"},
       "Maximum number of instructions per block"
     ],
diff --git a/FEXCore/Source/Interface/Core/Frontend.cpp b/FEXCore/Source/Interface/Core/Frontend.cpp
index 1234567..abcdefg 100644
--- a/FEXCore/Source/Interface/Core/Frontend.cpp
+++ b/FEXCore/Source/Interface/Core/Frontend.cpp
@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@ namespace FEXCore::Frontend {
   // Forward branch distance for multiblock merging
   // A76 has 64KB L1I cache and better branch prediction
   // Increased from 4 pages to 6 pages for A76 optimization
-  static constexpr uint64_t MAX_FORWARD_BRANCH_DIST = FEX_PAGE_SIZE * 4;
+  static constexpr uint64_t MAX_FORWARD_BRANCH_DIST = FEX_PAGE_SIZE * 6;
   
   Decoder::Decoder() = default;
-- 
